<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="home">
  <title>Home</title>
  <introduction>
    <p xml:id="home-welcome">Welcome to my homepage!</p>
    <p>I am a 2nd-year PhD student in mathematics at <url href="https://qzc.tsinghua.edu.cn/en/">Qiuzhen College</url>, <url href="https://www.tsinghua.edu.cn/en/">Tsinghua University</url> under the supervision of <url href="https://zhengzhiweimath.github.io/homepage/">Zhiwei Zheng</url>. This is my <url href="pdfs/CV.pdf">CV</url>.</p>
    <xi:include href="../profile.ptx"/>
  </introduction>
  <section xml:id="home-research-interests">
    <title>Research Interests</title>
    <p>Algebraic Geometry and related areas. I'm currently working on automorphism groups of hypersurfaces/hyperkähler manifolds. I'm also interested in moduli theory, quantum cohomology, Bridgeland stability and mirror symmetry.</p>
  </section>
